  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian Demining Activities in Putumayo, Colombia Phase III</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CCBL aims to contribute to communal safety and wellbeing in Putumayo by enabling the local population the use of their land, for productive, conservation or religious motives, free from the threat of explosive ordnance. The ultimate goal is to support, with all the means available to the organization, Colombia&apos;s broad task to have a mine-free country in 2025 through the developing of humanitarian demining activities.</narrative>
  </description>
